	"descriptionMarkdown": "This is Aurora.\nStarship properties:\nSize: 12(w)x438(h)\nWeight: 860t\nCargo: 15x\nThrusters: 4x\nTanks: 50K\nEnergy: ~35MW/305MJ\nTurrets: 24x gun,18x laser->42 total\n\nIt's ultra fast. It's ultra thin, but still it has it's own unique design.\nIt uses nuclear power and it manufactures own nuclear fuel!\nIt's self sustain and prevents any overloads of collectors.\nShip contains control panel where engines efficiency can be set.\nShip contains indicator system for levels of energy,fluids and ammo.\nShip contains blinking navigation lights.\n\n© Designed by Velda\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@VeldaGames/\n\nHowever it's a mid-game ship and it uses standard rocket thrusters, max. speed of this ship is around 370km/s! This ship has width only 12tiles. It's very long and it's using vertical stacking for engines but in the same time it has its own unique design.\nShip was calibrated and tested on standard trips between Nauvis and Gleba. With default control panel setup (105) ship reaches 29% fuel consumption, 95% efficiency but still very fast speed 180km/s. With this speed trip between Nauvis and Gleba takes approx 80 seconds. \n\nShip has got implemented kovarex enrichment process, so you don't need to worry about refueling and energy for a very long time (indicator of uran supplies is also included). However, you will need to provide the ship with some uran 235 and 238 from the planet at the beginning and also build some solar panels to start the process of creating uran on the ship.\n\nI personally flew 10-times from Gleba to Nauvis back and forth without any needs to stop for ammo replenishment or refueling - still in green numbers.",
